---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Home
permalink: /home/index.html
---
<section class="frontpage">
  <div class="masthead-block">
    <div class="eyebrow">EAL WEEKLY</div>
    <h1>AI, explained for everyone.</h1>
    <p class="editorial-summary">A bilingual weekly journal covering AI news, tools, and ideas in plain language.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="divider"></div>

  <div class="issue-panel">
    <div class="issue-header">
      <span>THIS WEEK</span>
      <time>2026.08.24 — 2026.08.30</time>
    </div>

    <ul class="headline-list">
      <li>
        <span class="dot"></span>
        <div>
          <h3>AI Agents are becoming physical</h3>
          <p>Anthropic 发布 Model Hardware Standard</p>
        </div>
      </li>
      <li>
        <span class="dot"></span>
        <div>
          <h3>AI Agents broke out of their sandbox</h3>
          <p>OpenAI / Hugging Face 安全事件调查</p>
        </div>
      </li>
      <li>
        <span class="dot"></span>
        <div>
          <h3>China’s open-source AI push</h3>
          <p>腾讯发布新的开源模型</p>
        </div>
      </li>
    </ul>

    <div class="cta-row">
      <a href="/episodes/" class="primary-link">Read this week's issue</a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="divider"></div>

  <section class="featured-section">
    <div class="featured-topbar">
      <h2>精选文章</h2>
      <a href="/episodes/">查看全部</a>
    </div>

    <div class="week-groups">
      {% for group in collections.weekGroups | slice(0, 4) %}
        <article class="week-group">
          <div class="week-header">
            <div class="week-label">{{ group.weekLabel }}</div>
            <time>{{ group.start | date("yyyy-LL-dd") }} — {{ group.end | date("yyyy-LL-dd") }}</time>
          </div>

          <div class="language-grid">
            <div class="language-column">
              <div class="language-tag chinese">中文</div>
              {% for ep in group.zh %}
                <a class="story-card" href="{{ ep.url }}">
                  <span class="story-date">{{ ep.data.date | date("yyyy-LL-dd") }}</span>
                  <strong>{{ ep.data.title }}</strong>
                  <p>{{ ep.data.summary }}</p>
                </a>
              {% endfor %}
            </div>

            <div class="language-column">
              <div class="language-tag english">English</div>
              {% for ep in group.en %}
                <a class="story-card" href="{{ ep.url }}">
                  <span class="story-date">{{ ep.data.date | date("yyyy-LL-dd") }}</span>
                  <strong>{{ ep.data.title }}</strong>
                  <p>{{ ep.data.summary }}</p>
                </a>
              {% endfor %}
            </div>
          </div>
        </article>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="divider"></div>

  <section class="explore-section">
    <h2>EXPLORE</h2>
    <div class="topic-grid">
      <span>AI News</span>
      <span>AI Explained</span>
      <span>Tutorials</span>
      <span>Tools</span>
      <span>Research</span>
      <span>AI × Education</span>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="divider"></div>

  <section class="learn-section">
    <h2>LEARN</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>What is an AI Agent?</li>
      <li>What is an LLM?</li>
      <li>How does RAG work?</li>
      <li>What does "open source AI" actually mean?</li>
    </ul>
  </section>
</section>
